{%- comment -%}
  Garantie Tranquillité 24 mois — optional paid additional warranty under the buy buttons (PDP).
  COMPACT layout (Mat 2026-11-02: "juste la case à cocher, Garantie Tranquillité 2 ans"):
    one line = checkbox + name + price, and a "Détails ▾" toggle (summary + legal notice link + full terms).
  Compliance (docs/legal-review/garantie-A-redaction.md, lawyer-approved) is kept by a 2-step dialog that opens
  the first time the box is ticked: step 1 = the prescribed "AVIS SUR LES GARANTIES LÉGALES" ALONE (Règlement
  art. 91.9 d) / 91.10, décret 1459-2025), printable; step 2 = plain-language summary (coverage, main exclusions,
  10-day free cancellation, free warranties) + "Ajouter la garantie". The box is only ticked from step 2, so the
  notice and the summary are always shown before the warranty can be added; the opening time is stored on the
  cart line (_avis_garanties_ouvert) as proof.
  Never offered on items tagged `sans-garantie-tranquillite` / `garantie-legale-6ans` / `garantie-legale-5ans`
  (art. 38.1 appliances), nor above 2 000 $ (no price bracket).

  Sold as the internal product `garantie-tranquillite-2-ans` (variant per 10 $ bracket, 10 %). Shown when the
  shop metafield custom.warranty_enabled is true, or ?lc_garantie=1 for QA (remembered for the session).
  Accepts: product (Object), section_id (String)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign lc_w = all_products['garantie-tranquillite-2-ans'] -%}
{%- if lc_w != blank and lc_w.available and product.handle != lc_w.handle and product.price > 0 -%}
{%- unless product.tags contains 'sans-garantie-tranquillite' or product.tags contains 'garantie-legale-6ans' or product.tags contains 'garantie-legale-5ans' -%}
  {%- assign loc = request.locale.iso_code | downcase -%}
  {%- assign en = false -%}{%- if loc == 'en' -%}{%- assign en = true -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign lc_w_enabled = shop.metafields.custom.warranty_enabled.value | default: false -%}
  {%- assign lc_terms_url = routes.root_url | append: '/pages/garantie-tranquillite' | replace: '//pages', '/pages' -%}
  {%- capture lc_summary -%}
    {%- if en -%}
      <p><strong>Covers</strong> manufacturing, material or design defects in normal home use, for 24 months after delivery: parts, repair or replacement at our cost.</p>
      <p><strong>Does not cover</strong> accidents (falls, stains, spills), pets, normal wear, abuse or ignoring the instructions and maximum load, commercial or rental use, weather, moving, modifications, cosmetic defects. <a href="{{ lc_terms_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Full terms</a>.</p>
      <p>Your free warranties stay in full: legal warranty + Ameublo 1-year base warranty. <strong>Cancel free within 10 days</strong> of your order (30 days after delivery under our terms), then prorated refund. Provided by Ameublo Direct, no insurer.</p>
    {%- else -%}
      <p><strong>Couvre</strong> les défauts de fabrication, de matériaux ou de conception lors d’un usage normal à la maison, pendant 24 mois après la livraison : pièces, réparation ou remplacement à nos frais.</p>
      <p><strong>Ne couvre pas</strong> les accidents (chutes, taches, déversements), les animaux, l’usure normale, l’abus ou le non-respect de la notice et de la charge maximale, l’usage commercial ou locatif, les intempéries, les déménagements, les modifications, les défauts esthétiques. <a href="{{ lc_terms_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Conditions complètes</a>.</p>
      <p>Vos garanties gratuites restent entières : garantie légale + garantie de base Ameublo 1 an. <strong>Annulable sans frais dans les 10 jours</strong> de la commande (30 jours après la livraison selon nos conditions), ensuite remboursement au prorata. Accordée par Ameublo Direct, sans assureur.</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}
  <div class="lc-warranty" data-lc-warranty data-section-id="{{ section_id }}" data-enabled="{{ lc_w_enabled }}"
       data-product-title="{{ product.title | escape }}" hidden>
    <div class="lc-warranty__row">
      <label class="lc-warranty__opt">
        <input type="checkbox" data-lc-warranty-check>
        <span><strong>{%- if en -%}2-Year Peace-of-Mind Warranty{%- else -%}Garantie Tranquillité 2 ans{%- endif -%}</strong> <span class="lc-warranty__price" data-lc-warranty-price></span></span>
      </label>
      <button type="button" class="lc-warranty__more" data-lc-warranty-more aria-expanded="false">{%- if en -%}Details{%- else -%}Détails{%- endif -%} <span aria-hidden="true">▾</span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="lc-warranty__details" data-lc-warranty-details hidden>
      {{ lc_summary }}
      <p><button type="button" class="lc-warranty__link" data-lc-warranty-notice-open>{%- if en -%}Notice on legal warranties{%- else -%}Avis sur les garanties légales{%- endif -%}</button></p>
    </div>

    <dialog class="lc-wnotice" data-lc-warranty-dialog aria-labelledby="LcWNotice-{{ section_id }}">
      <div class="lc-wnotice__step" data-step="1">
        <div class="lc-wnotice__body" data-lc-warranty-notice>
          <h2 id="LcWNotice-{{ section_id }}" class="lc-wnotice__h">AVIS SUR LES GARANTIES LÉGALES</h2>
          <p class="lc-wnotice__box">La loi accorde une garantie gratuite sur le bien que vous achetez ou louez : il doit pouvoir servir à son usage normal pendant une durée raisonnable.</p>
          <div class="lc-wnotice__box">
            <p>La Loi sur la protection du consommateur accorde des garanties gratuites sur tous les biens que vous achetez ou louez d’un commerçant.</p>
            <p>Le bien doit pouvoir servir :</p>
            <p>— à l’usage auquel il est normalement destiné (article 37 de la Loi);</p>
            <p>— à un usage normal pendant une durée raisonnable, qui peut varier selon le prix payé, les dispositions du contrat et les conditions d’utilisation (article 38 de la Loi).</p>
          </div>
          <p class="lc-wnotice__foot">Pour plus de renseignements sur les garanties, informez-vous auprès de l’Office de la protection du consommateur au Québec.ca/garanties-consommateur.</p>
          {%- if en -%}
            <hr>
            <h2 class="lc-wnotice__h">NOTICE ON LEGAL WARRANTIES</h2>
            <p class="lc-wnotice__box">The law provides a free warranty on the goods you buy or lease: they must be fit for normal use for a reasonable length of time.</p>
            <div class="lc-wnotice__box">
              <p>The Consumer Protection Act provides free warranties on all goods you buy or lease from a merchant.</p>
              <p>The goods must be fit:</p>
              <p>— for the purpose for which they are ordinarily used (section 37 of the Act);</p>
              <p>— for normal use for a reasonable length of time, which may vary according to the price paid, the terms of the contract and the conditions of use (section 38 of the Act).</p>
            </div>
            <p class="lc-wnotice__foot">For more information on warranties, contact the Office de la protection du consommateur at Québec.ca/garanties-consommateur.</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="lc-wnotice__actions">
          <button type="button" class="button button--secondary" data-lc-warranty-print>{%- if en -%}Print{%- else -%}Imprimer{%- endif -%}</button>
          <button type="button" class="button" data-lc-warranty-next>{%- if en -%}Continue{%- else -%}Continuer{%- endif -%}</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lc-wnotice__step" data-step="2" hidden>
        <div class="lc-wnotice__body lc-wnotice__summary">
          <h2 class="lc-wnotice__h2">{%- if en -%}2-Year Peace-of-Mind Warranty{%- else -%}Garantie Tranquillité 2 ans{%- endif -%} <span data-lc-warranty-price2></span></h2>
          {{ lc_summary }}
        </div>
        <div class="lc-wnotice__actions">
          <button type="button" class="button button--secondary" data-lc-warranty-cancel>{%- if en -%}No thanks{%- else -%}Non merci{%- endif -%}</button>
          <button type="button" class="button" data-lc-warranty-accept>{%- if en -%}Add the warranty{%- else -%}Ajouter la garantie{%- endif -%}</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </dialog>

    <script type="application/json" data-lc-warranty-tiers>
      {
        "tiers": [{%- for v in lc_w.variants -%}{%- if v.available -%}{"max": {{ v.option1 | plus: 0 }}, "id": {{ v.id }}, "price": {{ v.price }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}],
        "variants": [{%- for v in product.variants -%}{"id": {{ v.id }}, "price": {{ v.price }}, "title": {{ v.title | json }}, "sku": {{ v.sku | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}],
        "en": {{ en | json }}
      }
    </script>
  </div>
  <style>
    .lc-warranty{margin:.2rem 0 1.2rem;padding:.9rem 1.1rem;border:1px solid rgba(26,35,64,.18);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;font-size:1.4rem;line-height:1.4;color:#1A2340}
    .lc-warranty__row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem}
    .lc-warranty__opt{display:flex;gap:.9rem;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;min-width:0}
    .lc-warranty__opt input{width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;margin:0;flex:0 0 auto;accent-color:#1A2340}
    .lc-warranty__price{font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
    .lc-warranty__more,.lc-warranty__link{all:unset;cursor:pointer;font-size:1.25rem;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;white-space:nowrap;color:#1A2340}
    .lc-warranty__details{margin-top:.8rem;font-size:1.2rem;opacity:.9}
    .lc-warranty__details p{margin:0 0 .5rem}
    .lc-warranty__details a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline}
    .lc-wnotice{max-width:640px;width:calc(100% - 32px);border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:0;color:#000;background:#fff}
    .lc-wnotice::backdrop{background:rgba(0,0,0,.55)}
    .lc-wnotice__body{padding:24px 22px 8px;max-height:68vh;overflow:auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
    .lc-wnotice__h{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0;font-family:inherit}
    .lc-wnotice__h2{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;font-family:inherit}
    .lc-wnotice__box{border:2px solid #000;padding:10px 12px;margin:0 0 14px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.4}
    .lc-wnotice__box p{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:19px}
    .lc-wnotice__foot{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 12px}
    .lc-wnotice__summary p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;margin:0 0 10px}
    .lc-wnotice__summary a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline}
    .lc-wnotice__actions{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:flex-end;padding:12px 22px 20px}
  </style>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var box = document.querySelector('[data-lc-warranty][data-section-id="{{ section_id }}"]');
      if (!box || box.dataset.bound) return;
      box.dataset.bound = '1';
      try { if (new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('lc_garantie') === '1') sessionStorage.setItem('lcGarantie', '1'); } catch (e) {}
      var preview = false;
      try { preview = sessionStorage.getItem('lcGarantie') === '1'; } catch (e) {}
      if (box.dataset.enabled !== 'true' && !preview) return;

      var cfg = JSON.parse(box.querySelector('[data-lc-warranty-tiers]').textContent);
      if (!cfg.tiers.length) return;
      cfg.tiers.sort(function (a, b) { return a.max - b.max; });
      var en = cfg.en;
      var $ = function (s) { return box.querySelector(s); };
      var check = $('[data-lc-warranty-check]');
      var dialog = $('[data-lc-warranty-dialog]');
      var step1 = dialog.querySelector('[data-step="1"]');
      var step2 = dialog.querySelector('[data-step="2"]');
      var section = box.dataset.sectionId;
      var mainForm = document.getElementById('product-form-' + section);
      var noticeOpenedAt = '';
      var accepted = false;

      function selectedVariant() {
        var input = mainForm && mainForm.querySelector('input[name="id"]');
        var id = input ? Number(input.value) : cfg.variants[0].id;
        return cfg.variants.find(function (v) { return v.id === id; }) || cfg.variants[0];
      }
      function tierFor(cents) {
        var d = cents / 100;
        return cfg.tiers.find(function (t) { return d <= t.max; }) || null;
      }
      function money(cents) {
        return en ? '$' + (cents / 100).toFixed(2) : (cents / 100).toFixed(2).replace('.', ',') + ' $';
      }
      function refresh() {
        var t = tierFor(selectedVariant().price);
        if (!t) { box.hidden = true; check.checked = false; return; }
        box.hidden = false;
        var txt = '— ' + money(t.price);
        $('[data-lc-warranty-price]').textContent = txt;
        dialog.querySelector('[data-lc-warranty-price2]').textContent = txt + (en ? ' (plus taxes)' : ' (taxes en sus)');
      }
      refresh();
      document.addEventListener('change', function (e) {
        if (e.target.closest && e.target.closest('variant-selects')) setTimeout(refresh, 400);
      });
      var idInput = mainForm && mainForm.querySelector('input[name="id"]');
      if (idInput) new MutationObserver(refresh).observe(idInput, { attributes: true, attributeFilter: ['value'] });

      function show(stepNo) {
        step1.hidden = stepNo !== 1;
        step2.hidden = stepNo !== 2;
        if (!dialog.open) { if (dialog.showModal) dialog.showModal(); else dialog.setAttribute('open', ''); }
        if (!noticeOpenedAt) noticeOpenedAt = new Date().toISOString();
      }
      function close() { if (dialog.close) dialog.close(); else dialog.removeAttribute('open'); }

      // Ticking the box: the first time, the notice (step 1) then the summary (step 2) must be shown;
      // the box is only ticked by "Ajouter la garantie".
      check.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        if (check.checked && !accepted) { e.preventDefault(); show(1); }
      });
      $('[data-lc-warranty-next]').addEventListener('click', function () { show(2); });
      $('[data-lc-warranty-accept]').addEventListener('click', function () { accepted = true; check.checked = true; close(); });
      $('[data-lc-warranty-cancel]').addEventListener('click', function () { check.checked = false; close(); });
      dialog.addEventListener('cancel', function () { if (!accepted) check.checked = false; });
      $('[data-lc-warranty-more]').addEventListener('click', function () {
        var d = $('[data-lc-warranty-details]');
        d.hidden = !d.hidden;
        this.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!d.hidden));
      });
      $('[data-lc-warranty-notice-open]').addEventListener('click', function () { show(1); });
      $('[data-lc-warranty-print]').addEventListener('click', function () {
        var w = window.open('', '_blank');
        if (!w) return window.print();
        w.document.write('<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Avis sur les garanties légales</title><style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:24px auto;color:#000}h2{font-size:19px;text-transform:uppercase}.lc-wnotice__box{border:2px solid #000;padding:10px 12px;margin:0 0 14px;font-size:19px}.lc-wnotice__foot{font-size:16px}</style>' + $('[data-lc-warranty-notice]').innerHTML);
        w.document.close();
        w.focus();
        w.print();
      });

      // Add the warranty line first, then let the original submit proceed (product form or buy-now form).
      var passing = false;
      function qtyFor(form) {
        var q = form.querySelector('input[name="quantity"]') || document.querySelector('#Quantity-' + section);
        return Math.max(1, parseInt(q && q.value, 10) || 1);
      }
      document.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
        var form = e.target;
        if (passing || box.hidden || !check.checked || !accepted) return;
        if (form !== mainForm && !form.classList.contains('buy-now-form')) return;
        var v = selectedVariant();
        var t = tierFor(v.price);
        if (!t) return;
        e.preventDefault();
        e.stopImmediatePropagation();
        var label = box.dataset.productTitle + (v.title && v.title !== 'Default Title' ? ' — ' + v.title : '') + (v.sku ? ' (' + v.sku + ')' : '');
        var props = {};
        props[en ? 'For' : 'Pour'] = label;
        props._lc_warranty_for = String(v.id);
        props._avis_garanties_ouvert = noticeOpenedAt;
        props._conditions_version = '1.0 (2026-11-02)';
        fetch('/cart/add.js', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', Accept: 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ items: [{ id: t.id, quantity: qtyFor(form), properties: props }] }),
        })
          .catch(function () {})
          .then(function () {
            passing = true;
            try { form.requestSubmit ? form.requestSubmit() : form.submit(); } finally { passing = false; }
          });
      }, true);
    })();
  </script>
{%- endunless -%}
{%- endif -%}
